葬祭张纲","accounts":[{"id":"dengzhang-a-de070e4c2ba9fd216a5b","label":"裴注·续汉书","text":"张婴等葬祭张纲","evidence":["dengzhang-q-f0bd6727307002934625"]}],"participants":[{"person":"dengzhang-p0016","role":"与三百余人衰杖送纲丧至武阳，葬讫为起冢立祠，四时奉祭","evidence":["dengzhang-q-f0bd6727307002934625"]},{"person":"dengzhang-p0021","role":"丧，为张婴等所送葬立祠","evidence":["dengzhang-q-f0bd6727307002934625"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["dengzhang-q-f0bd6727307002934625"]},"ordering_evidence":"dengzhang-q-f0bd6727307002934625","source_order":[45,71,1061],"order":7901}],"persons":[{"id":"dengzhang-p0016","name":"张婴","evidence":["dengzhang-q-bc61cf782a997b45527c","dengzhang-q-39aff595303242e57d26","dengzhang-q-2ae2bea39c6b8ec50b25","dengzhang-q-8c094f59e6c41f3aa8bd","dengzhang-q-a2331442a5a85b30eb0f","dengzhang-q-41dcb930852f5408d6dc","dengzhang-q-f0bd6727307002934625"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dengzhang-q-2ae2bea39c6b8ec50b25","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-8204d62ca48619f1ab78","layer":"pei","quote":"纲延置上坐，问其疾苦；礼毕，乃谓之曰：‘前后二千石，多非其人；杜塞国恩，肆其私求。乡郡远，天子不能朝夕闻也，故民人相聚以避害。二千石，信有罪矣；为之者，乃非义也。忠臣不欺君以自荣，孝子不损父以求福。天子（圣人）〔仁圣〕，欲文德以来之；故使大守来，思以爵禄相荣，不愿以刑也：今诚转祸为福之时也。若闻义不服，天子赫然（发）〔震〕怒，〔荆、扬、兖、豫〕大兵云合，岂不危乎？宜深计其利害！’婴闻，泣曰：‘荒裔愚人，数为二千石所侵枉；不堪其困，故遂相聚偷生。明府仁及草木，乃婴等更生之泽；但恐投兵之日，不免孥戮耳！’纲曰：‘岂其然乎！要之以天地，誓之以日月；方当相显以爵位，何祸之有乎？’婴曰：‘苟赦其罪，得全首领以就农亩，则抱戴没齿；爵禄，非所望也！’婴虽为大贼，起于狂暴，自以为必死；及得纲言，旷然开明，乃辞还营","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5879cbe3d59542c346b","start":520,"end":873,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-39aff595303242e57d26","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-8204d62ca48619f1ab78","layer":"pei","quote":"纲又于门外罢遣吏兵，留所亲者十余人，以书语其长老素为婴所信者；请与相见，问以本变；因示以诏恩，使还请婴。婴见纲意诚，即出见纲","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5879cbe3d59542c346b","start":457,"end":519,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-41dcb930852f5408d6dc","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-8204d62ca48619f1ab78","layer":"pei","quote":"天子美其功，征，欲用之。婴等上书，乞留在郡二岁","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5879cbe3d59542c346b","start":1021,"end":1044,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-8c094f59e6c41f3aa8bd","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-8204d62ca48619f1ab78","layer":"pei","quote":"明日，遂将所部万余人，与妻子面缚，诣纲降。纲悉释缚慰纳","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5879cbe3d59542c346b","start":874,"end":901,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-a2331442a5a85b30eb0f","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-8204d62ca48619f1ab78","layer":"pei","quote":"纲以其至诚，乃各从其意，亲为安处居宅；子弟欲为吏者，随才任职；欲为民者，劝以农桑；田业并丰，南州晏然","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5879cbe3d59542c346b","start":952,"end":1002,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-bc61cf782a997b45527c","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-8204d62ca48619f1ab78","layer":"pei","quote":"会广陵贼张婴等众数万人，杀刺史、二千石","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5879cbe3d59542c346b","start":340,"end":359,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-f0bd6727307002934625","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-8204d62ca48619f1ab78","layer":"pei","quote":"婴等三百余人，皆衰杖送纲丧至（洛）〔武〕阳；葬讫，为起冢立祠，四时奉祭","attribution":"裴注·续汉书","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5879cbe3d59542c346b","start":1061,"end":1096,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
